# 60 Days Data Science Challenge

This repository contains my journey through the 60 Days Data Science Challenge by ABTalks.

## Day 4 – Project Setup + Dataset Selection

### Domain
Sales

### Project Title
Sales Performance Analysis

### Problem Statement

Businesses generate large amounts of sales data, but raw data alone does not provide useful insights.

The objective of this project is to analyze sales data using Python and Data Science techniques to identify important patterns, trends, and factors affecting sales performance.

The analysis will help understand:

- Sales trends over time
- Best-performing products
- High-performing regions
- Revenue distribution
- Customer purchasing patterns
- Factors affecting overall sales performance

### Tools & Libraries

- Python
- NumPy
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook

### Dataset

The dataset will be selected from Kaggle and used for exploratory data analysis in the upcoming days.

